# ---- Never commit game data ------------------------------------------
*.sms
*.SMS
*.sg
*.bin
*.zip
*.bps
*.ips
*.sram
*.sav
*.mss
*.mst
*.md
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!NOTICE.md
!docs/*.md
!work/*.md
!PSI_Disasm/README.md

# Emulator savestates and memory dumps contain the game's RAM/VRAM.
*.state
*.st?
work/states/
work/analysis/

# ---- Third-party binaries: link to them, do not vendor them ------------
# (the 2006 WLA-DX build that ships in the disassembly is not used: tools/sourcebuild.py
# needs WLA-DX 10.7)
wla_dx_v*/
PSI_Disasm/binaries/
Mesen*/
Emulicious*/
flips/

# ---- Build products ---------------------------------------------------
PSI_Disasm/ps1.o
PSI_Disasm/ps1.log
PSI_Disasm/ps1built*.sms
PSI_Disasm/ps1built.sym
PSI_Disasm/bank_info.txt
release/PS1_Retranslation_v*/

# ---- Editor and interpreter litter ------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
.claude/
